province = 58
blurb = "Depicts travelers linking arms to measure the circumference of a gigantic tree, upper reaches cut off by the edge of the paper. A seated man is enjoying a puff of tobacco.

In the background is Mount Fuji, surrounded by fluffy clouds. The mountain's left slope is echoed by two diagonal lines: a tree branch hanging down from the edge of the paper, and the hills on the right.

The exact location of Mishima Pass is uncertain. It is speculated that it may be present-day Kagosaka Pass, between the Yamanashi and Shizuoka prefectures, or it could be fictitious."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://6kpsqyb2pk7a"
